OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start on Tuesday with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, sometimes heavy.
OL,7,FTurning drier through the afternoon
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells developing amongst
OL,9,Fheavy showers. A milder day, but with
OL,10,Fstrong winds along coasts and hills..
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FHeavy, locally thundery,
OL,13,Fshowers continuing this evening and
OL,14,Fovernight mixed with clear spells.
OL,15,FStaying windy along the coasts and
OL,16,Fover the hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
